Criterion:
    The user must be able to:
        - Use blocks to code a program
        - Use PyBlock to connect to a SPIKE Prime robot hub
        - Export/save/import files
        - Send the program to a robot, the program occupying 1 of 20 program slots
        - Remotely run the program without relying on remote running to run the program
        - Use PyBlock code to manipulate all motors in any possible way
        - Use a REPL to remote-control the robot